{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>You shall count fifty days.</b> And one must recite a blessing, for there is no interruption here. But in the case of a menstruant, even though it is written ״וספרה לה שבעת ימים״, she does not need to recite a blessing, because sometimes there is an interruption that invalidates everything, and it would be a blessing in vain."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:14:32.410248544Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}